WEBVTT

00:05:56.435 --> 00:06:00.022
And then what brought you to make
that crime that led you to prison.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:04.110
And if you changed,
explain how you changed and why."

00:06:04.151 --> 00:06:06.153
They all went, some stayed for 10 minutes,

00:06:06.195 --> 00:06:07.905
some stayed for 20, 30 minutes.

00:06:07.905 --> 00:06:10.658
Some of them were crying in that place.

00:06:11.409 --> 00:06:13.869
Then I went back to my studio
and that's what we do.

00:06:13.869 --> 00:06:15.996
We print strips of paper
like a giant puzzle,

00:06:15.996 --> 00:06:17.623
so we have to combine it together.

00:06:17.665 --> 00:06:20.167
It's all just paper and glue.

00:06:20.209 --> 00:06:22.461
And then we combine them by numbers,

00:06:22.503 --> 00:06:23.921
and then we went back there.

00:06:23.963 --> 00:06:26.841
And we started bringing
everybody in the yard.

00:06:27.341 --> 00:06:28.592
And we started pasting.

00:06:28.592 --> 00:06:31.887
Everyone from every gang,
every race, participated.